<title>UK: Barclays up ahead of fund manager meeting.</title>
<headline>Barclays up ahead of fund manager meeting.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Britain's Barclays Plc rose in pre-market trading on Tuesday after reports that the bank would hold a briefing for investment managers later today, traders said.</p>
<p>The stock was up 7p at 972-1/2 by 0815 GMT.  </p>
<p>No-one at Barclays was immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
